    "body": "## What\r\nProgressively enhance the review app cookie banner example so that it hides the banner with JavaScript if user has consented to cookies and JavaScript is enabled, and reloads the page if JS isn’t enabled.  \r\n\r\nWe should add an example to the review app for when the service is only collecting essential cookies both on client and server side.\r\n\r\n## Why \r\nTo help us to iterate the cookie banner guidance in https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-design-system/issues/1556 and add guidance and examples for the above. \r\n\r\n## Who needs to know about this\r\nDeveloper \r\n\r\n## Done when\r\n- [x] We've iterated/added the examples as above\r\n- [x] We've added any relevant findings to https://github.com/alphagov/govuk-design-system/issues/1556",
